<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,481 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,481 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,481 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,476 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 18		  Nov 15</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,481		   5,476</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
